  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Old Lord Can Yang asks him for the result of his calculation. His eyes fill with transforming clouds and mist while he works, then clear again, and he names a weak spot of saint regional wall as the place to cut an entrance toward Northern Plains. Deeper in that crossing he reinforces the other Gu Immortals’ minds with wisdom path methods and immortal killer moves when thought slows under the wall’s pressure. After the group reaches the far side of saint regional wall he warns that he could only deduce that wall, not how thick Northern Plains’ licorice regional wall would be, then later points a new direction so they finish the crossing.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_lord_can_yang",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "path_wisdom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is later remembered as the only wisdom path Gu Immortal within that whole Central Continent group.",
      "chapters": [
        991
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a young looking Gu Immortal. When he calculates, his eyes fill with clouds and mist that constantly transform. After the clouds and mist disperse he has ordinary white eyes with black pupils.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the Central Continent Gu Immortals secretly waiting near crimson reed marsh, he is the one from Ancient Soul Sect who holds an incomplete wisdom path inheritance, and the same stretch names him a wisdom path Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        756
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-inheritance-and-sect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge calls for the killer move gentleman’s bamboo. Old Oracle walks out, grows a colorless crystal bamboo from his palm, and states that the move uses the rank six Immortal Gu Bamboo Gentleman as its core with six hundred and sixty mortal Gu complementing it, that it is used specially for detecting lies, and that it can work against rank seven Gu Immortals but not against rank eight. While Feng Jiu Ge questions Qin Bai Sheng, the bamboo shows no color change, which the group treats as proof that the answers are truthful. Feng Jiu Ge then splits the force so one group can protect Old Oracle while he deduces in peace.",
      "chapters": [
        768
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-detects-lies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_bamboo_gentleman_gu",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Trying to deduce the culprit behind the collapse of True Yang Building leaves him exhausted. His sideburns turn white, and his young face becomes much older and wrinkled. He walks out of a secret room and tells the other immortals his attainment was insufficient, then stays behind with Feng Jiu Ge and admits he had made a huge breakthrough and lied about failure because Feng Jiu Ge ordered the information concealed. Feng Jiu Ge says the deduction points to a member of the ten great sects of Central Continent and that he already suspected Ancient Soul Sect; Old Oracle confirms the sect gave him secret missions as well and leaves.",
      "chapters": [
        777
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-yang-building-deduction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "fac_ten_great_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A thunderbolt brushes past him, tears away almost half his body, and leaves him close to death. After he restores his body he mutters that he was not able to predict that thunderbolt.",
      "chapters": [
        813
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "near-miss-in-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the hundred days battle at Luo Po Valley, Old Oracle from Ancient Soul Sect has died, along with two Gu Immortals from Spirit Butterfly Valley and Combat Immortal Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        922
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "near-miss-in-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "fac_combat_immortal_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hong Chi Ming later speaks in his place now that Ancient Soul Sect’s Old Oracle had died, and the withdrawal talk repeats that Old Oracle has died while Feng Jiu Ge is trapped.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "near-miss-in-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hong_chi_ming"
      ]
    }
  ],
